---
title: Weekly Logs
permalink: /weeks/
---
<p>Newest week first. Check off each day as it's done — the
<a href="/progress/">progress page</a> charts every checkbox.</p>
<ul class="week-list">
  {%- for week in collections.weeks %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ week.url }}">Week {{ week.data.week }}</a>
    <span class="dates">{{ week.data.dateRange }}</span>
    {% adherenceBadge week %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
